  "body": "In section 2.4.1 Terminology [of URLs], [**document base URL**](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/urls-and-fetching.html#document-base-url) is defined as an [absolute URL](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#syntax-url-absolute).\r\n\r\nIn the URL standard, an  **absolute URL** is a string. But the defining algorithm of **document base URL** returns a URL record, and it is used as a URL record in its references (caveat: I've not made a comprehensive review).\r\n\r\n**document base URL** should be defined as a [URL record](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url) instead.",
